{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The SanDisk card fits my repeated use of memory cards, adapters, and a card reader; its 32GB capacity makes it a familiar, practical addition to my setup.",
    "A streaming stick offers another way to use my TV alongside my DVD player, and the longer HDMI cable could help with equipment placement. TV controls matter more to me than 4K on my 720p TV."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo speakers and earbuds introduce uses I am not currently seeking; my recent purchases mostly help me connect, maintain, or expand equipment I already use.",
    "A home monitoring camera does not serve the photography needs behind my tripods and lens cap, and six one-foot Ethernet cables do not match a connection need I currently have."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Owning a Fire tablet seems to have been taken as interest in a broader range of Alexa devices, although a voice speaker solves no current need for me.",
    "My interest in cables and camera accessories seems to have been extended to items with different purposes; the exact connection, length, and camera use matter to my choice."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated memory-card purchases, storage cases, and card reader show an ongoing need for storage that works with my devices and adapters.",
    "The streaming sticks are alternatives for one TV need, so liking several does not mean I would buy several; useful controls and suitability for my existing TV determine which one I would choose."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognized my storage and TV needs but stretched my equipment purchases into interest in unrelated electronics."
}"}
